{"title":"Daniel","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Daniel"},"headingText":"Daniel","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n\n::: {.book-summary}\n## Book Summary Insight\n\nDaniel demonstrates God's sovereignty over earthly kingdoms through faithful servants living in exile. The book teaches that God's kingdom ultimately triumphs over every human empire.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 1\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 1:8</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Daniel purposed in his heart</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nDefining verse of Daniel's faithfulness\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter records Daniel's resolve to remain faithful in Babylon. The key verse highlights unwavering obedience despite cultural pressure.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 2\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 2:21</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">He changes the times and the seasons</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nGod's sovereignty over history\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter recounts Nebuchadnezzar's dream of successive kingdoms. The key verse reveals God's eternal kingdom that will outlast all earthly powers.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 3\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 3:17</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Our God whom we serve is able to deliver us</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nFaith in the fiery furnace\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter records the fiery furnace and God's deliverance. The key verse demonstrates faithfulness to God regardless of consequences.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 4\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 4:35</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">None can stay His hand</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nNebuchadnezzar's confession\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter describes Nebuchadnezzar's humbling and restoration. The key verse emphasizes God's sovereignty over human rulers.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 5\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 5:27</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Thou art weighed in the balances</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nWriting on the wall\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter records Belshazzar's feast and Babylon's fall. The key verse demonstrates that God judges pride and irreverence.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 6\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 6:10</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Daniel prayed as he did before</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nDaniel in the lions' den\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter recounts Daniel in the lions' den. The key verse highlights steadfast faithfulness and God's power to save.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 7\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 7:14</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">His dominion is an everlasting dominion</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nMessianic kingdom prophecy\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter contains Daniel's vision of four beasts. The key verse points to the everlasting kingdom of the Son of Man.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 8\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 8:14</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Unto two thousand and three hundred days</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nMajor prophetic verse\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter presents a vision of future empires and conflicts. The key verse demonstrates God's control of history before it unfolds.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 9\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 9:24</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Seventy weeks are determined</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nOne of the most studied prophecies\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter records Daniel's prayer and the prophecy of the seventy weeks. The key verse emphasizes repentance and God's redemptive timetable.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 10\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 10:12</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Fear not, Daniel</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nHeavenly encouragement\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter reveals spiritual conflict behind earthly events. The key verse highlights God's encouragement to those who seek Him.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 11\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 11:32</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">The people that do know their God shall be strong</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nFrequently quoted encouragement\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter details future kingdoms and struggles. The key verse demonstrates the accuracy and certainty of God's prophetic word.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 12\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 12:3</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">They that be wise shall shine</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nResurrection and reward\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter concludes with promises of resurrection and final deliverance. The key verse offers hope beyond suffering through God's ultimate victory.\n:::\n\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n# Daniel\n\n::: {.book-summary}\n## Book Summary Insight\n\nDaniel demonstrates God's sovereignty over earthly kingdoms through faithful servants living in exile. The book teaches that God's kingdom ultimately triumphs over every human empire.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 1\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 1:8</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Daniel purposed in his heart</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nDefining verse of Daniel's faithfulness\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter records Daniel's resolve to remain faithful in Babylon. The key verse highlights unwavering obedience despite cultural pressure.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 2\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 2:21</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">He changes the times and the seasons</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nGod's sovereignty over history\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter recounts Nebuchadnezzar's dream of successive kingdoms. The key verse reveals God's eternal kingdom that will outlast all earthly powers.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 3\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 3:17</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Our God whom we serve is able to deliver us</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nFaith in the fiery furnace\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter records the fiery furnace and God's deliverance. The key verse demonstrates faithfulness to God regardless of consequences.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 4\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 4:35</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">None can stay His hand</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nNebuchadnezzar's confession\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter describes Nebuchadnezzar's humbling and restoration. The key verse emphasizes God's sovereignty over human rulers.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 5\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 5:27</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Thou art weighed in the balances</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nWriting on the wall\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter records Belshazzar's feast and Babylon's fall. The key verse demonstrates that God judges pride and irreverence.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 6\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 6:10</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Daniel prayed as he did before</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nDaniel in the lions' den\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter recounts Daniel in the lions' den. The key verse highlights steadfast faithfulness and God's power to save.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 7\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 7:14</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">His dominion is an everlasting dominion</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nMessianic kingdom prophecy\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter contains Daniel's vision of four beasts. The key verse points to the everlasting kingdom of the Son of Man.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 8\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 8:14</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Unto two thousand and three hundred days</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nMajor prophetic verse\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter presents a vision of future empires and conflicts. The key verse demonstrates God's control of history before it unfolds.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 9\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 9:24</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Seventy weeks are determined</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nOne of the most studied prophecies\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter records Daniel's prayer and the prophecy of the seventy weeks. The key verse emphasizes repentance and God's redemptive timetable.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 10\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 10:12</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">Fear not, Daniel</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nHeavenly encouragement\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter reveals spiritual conflict behind earthly events. The key verse highlights God's encouragement to those who seek Him.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 11\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 11:32</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">The people that do know their God shall be strong</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nFrequently quoted encouragement\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter details future kingdoms and struggles. The key verse demonstrates the accuracy and certainty of God's prophetic word.\n:::\n\n::: {.chapter-entry}\n## Chapter 12\n\n<div class=\"key-verse\">Daniel 12:3</div>\n\n<div class=\"identifier\">They that be wise shall shine</div>\n\n### Why This Verse\n\nResurrection and reward\n\n### Chapter Insight\n\nThis chapter concludes with promises of resurrection and final deliverance. The key verse offers hope beyond suffering through God's ultimate victory.\n:::\n\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],